	(text "USB power input for testing.\n2S power input for operation.\nNote that camera, servo, and igniters use input voltage directly, \nensure those components will operate at 2s voltages.\nTPS562152 is a micro-amp standby current device, which was chosen to\nsupport long pad duration with only Out Computer running."
